server.detail:
One payload for the profile:
- stats {answered, right, accuracy, accuracy7, minutes_total, minutes_week, active_days, streak, best_streak, since, tests, sections, modules, sets, mistakes_open, mistakes_fixed, saved, hard_right, qotd {answered, right}, challenges_played}
- score {latest, best, points: [{at, low, high, kind, session}]}
- domains [{domain, mastery, answered, right, skills: [{topic, name, mastery, answered, right, traps}]}]
- catching: top 5 traps by hits over all rows (open or closed) [{template, reason, label, topic, hits, open, last}]
- coverage [{topic, met, total}] — met = distinct templates in practice_seen ∪ attempts, total = len(catalogue.by_topic[topic])
- challenge {week_rank, week_players, best_rank, best_day, played, ahead_today}
- resume [up to 3]
- goals {plan fields, first_day}

Disputed attempts are excluded from every count.
